            Face-to-face consultation sessions are held at the Private Advisory Suite, Prudential Agency Office, Kota Kasablanka Mall Tower, 15th Floor. Equipped with a soundproof room, policy presentation audio-visual, a barista coffee corner, and VIP parking access.
          </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
