</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary p-2 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg">local_cafe</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface">Executive Lounge</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">A relaxed professional atmosphere without distractions.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="space-y-4">
<img class="w-full h-48 sm:h-56 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-md" data-alt="Modern executive meeting room in a high-rise tower in Jakarta with floor to ceiling windows, sleek dark wooden conference table, comfortable leather chairs, warm architectural lighting, and subtle Prudential crimson accents." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA3Mf64tamX4nEIC1F_zfSXgBYAquvf1q4J4pymWKjrd09Oa8fYqJvLEFDGqqM5fAyq7p4KR3_3Fwvx8LGawRcsiozIRk7Jnb7zdEow-llvucHAPs7Linkxt4KJGEkqGB6j9POEqBBbGFMS5oRbS2THe9cOR7ipIUufq_TAHV-mGts4Bz2RrGshU0s4lDSNO1Kf5O6scwyC03AdvqnJ2cJg4jQH4TZ87ktmzkWE8hSh"/>
